# DFIR evidence and test logs must stay byte-for-byte identical on every OS,
# so the SHA-256 chain-of-custody hashes recorded in GROUND-TRUTH.md keep
# matching. Without this, git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) rewrites LF to
# CRLF on checkout and the recomputed hash no longer matches.
apps/desktop-ui/testdata/** -text
